Care Instructions:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Wash separately from other clothes. The maximum washing temperature is 30&#xB0;C at a very gentle washing cycle.&#xD;
Tumble dry. Use a lower temperature. The highest temperature is 60&#xB0;C.&#xD;
Only use oxygen/chlorine-free bleach.&#xD;
The maximum temperature of the ironing board should be 110&#xB0;C for ironing and heating. Steam should not be used, as it may cause irreversible damage. Do not professionally dry clean.&#xD;
Please use mild detergent to clean. Please take it out immediately after washing and drying.&#xD;

